{"duration": 74.19, "segments": [{"scene": "hook", "text": "Don Julio levantó un segundo piso. Y la ventana nueva da directo al patio de doña Elena.", "pause": 0.3, "start": 0.4, "end": 5.54, "words": [{"w": "Don", "s": 0.4, "e": 0.58}, {"w": "Julio", "s": 0.58, "e": 1.0}, {"w": "levantó", "s": 1.0, "e": 1.42}, {"w": "un", "s": 1.42, "e": 1.58}, {"w": "segundo", "s": 1.58, "e": 1.92}, {"w": "piso", "s": 1.92, "e": 2.44}, {"w": "y", "s": 2.44, "e": 2.78}, {"w": "la", "s": 2.78, "e": 2.9}, {"w": "ventana", "s": 2.9, "e": 3.3}, {"w": "nueva", "s": 3.3, "e": 3.58}, {"w": "da", "s": 3.58, "e": 3.82}, {"w": "directo", "s": 3.82, "e": 4.3}, {"w": "al", "s": 4.3, "e": 4.38}, {"w": "patio", "s": 4.38, "e": 4.62}, {"w": "de", "s": 4.62, "e": 4.8}, {"w": "Doña", "s": 4.8, "e": 5.04}, {"w": "Elena.", "s": 5.04, "e": 5.24}]}, {"scene": "elena", "text": "Ahí ella lava, tiende la ropa y juega con sus nietos. Ahora se siente vigilada.", "pause": 0.3, "start": 5.84, "end": 10.61, "words": [{"w": "Ahí", "s": 5.84, "e": 6.06}, {"w": "ella", "s": 6.06, "e": 6.28}, {"w": "lava,", "s": 6.28, "e": 6.56}, {"w": "tiende", "s": 6.76, "e": 6.98}, {"w": "la", "s": 6.98, "e": 7.14}, {"w": "ropa", "s": 7.14, "e": 7.48}, {"w": "y", "s": 7.48, "e": 7.56}, {"w": "juega", "s": 7.56, "e": 7.9}, {"w": "con", "s": 7.9, "e": 8.08}, {"w": "sus", "s": 8.08, "e": 8.26}, {"w": "nietos.", "s": 8.26, "e": 8.82}, {"w": "Ahora", "s": 9.12, "e": 9.32}, {"w": "se", "s": 9.32, "e": 9.56}, {"w": "siente", "s": 9.56, "e": 9.9}, {"w": "vigilada.", "s": 9.9, "e": 10.46}]}, {"scene": "julio", "text": "Para él es diferente: es su terreno, su dinero, y su familia necesitaba espacio.", "pause": 0.3, "start": 10.91, "end": 15.66, "words": [{"w": "Para", "s": 10.91, "e": 11.13}, {"w": "él", "s": 11.13, "e": 11.27}, {"w": "es", "s": 11.27, "e": 11.37}, {"w": "diferente,", "s": 11.37, "e": 11.87}, {"w": "es", "s": 12.29, "e": 12.43}, {"w": "su", "s": 12.43, "e": 12.59}, {"w": "terreno,", "s": 12.59, "e": 13.03}, {"w": "su", "s": 13.15, "e": 13.21}, {"w": "dinero", "s": 13.21, "e": 13.55}, {"w": "y", "s": 13.55, "e": 13.93}, {"w": "su", "s": 13.93, "e": 14.07}, {"w": "familia", "s": 14.07, "e": 14.45}, {"w": "necesitaba", "s": 14.45, "e": 15.15}, {"w": "espacio.", "s": 15.15, "e": 15.35}]}, {"scene": "dialogo", "who": "elena", "voice": "ef_dora", "text": "Esa ventana me quitó la privacidad de mi casa.", "pause": 0.25, "start": 15.96, "end": 18.87, "words": [{"w": "Esa", "s": 15.96, "e": 16.26}, {"w": "ventana", "s": 16.26, "e": 16.76}, {"w": "me", "s": 16.76, "e": 17.0}, {"w": "quitó", "s": 17.0, "e": 17.38}, {"w": "la", "s": 17.38, "e": 17.48}, {"w": "privacidad", "s": 17.48, "e": 18.04}, {"w": "de", "s": 18.04, "e": 18.18}, {"w": "mi", "s": 18.18, "e": 18.24}, {"w": "casa.", "s": 18.24, "e": 18.54}]}, {"scene": "dialogo", "who": "julio", "voice": "em_santa", "text": "Yo construyo en lo mío. Nadie me puede decir nada.", "pause": 0.35, "start": 19.12, "end": 22.25, "words": [{"w": "Yo", "s": 19.12, "e": 19.32}, {"w": "construyo", "s": 19.32, "e": 19.94}, {"w": "en", "s": 19.94, "e": 20.04}, {"w": "lo", "s": 20.04, "e": 20.14}, {"w": "mío,", "s": 20.14, "e": 20.52}, {"w": "nadie", "s": 20.68, "e": 21.0}, {"w": "me", "s": 21.0, "e": 21.18}, {"w": "puede", "s": 21.18, "e": 21.42}, {"w": "decir", "s": 21.42, "e": 21.7}, {"w": "nada.", "s": 21.7, "e": 22.02}]}, {"scene": "tension", "text": "Los dos defienden algo legítimo: el derecho a construir, y el derecho a la privacidad.", "pause": 0.3, "start": 22.6, "end": 27.65, "words": [{"w": "Los", "s": 22.6, "e": 22.78}, {"w": "dos", "s": 22.78, "e": 22.96}, {"w": "defienden", "s": 22.96, "e": 23.54}, {"w": "algo", "s": 23.54, "e": 23.78}, {"w": "legítimo,", "s": 23.78, "e": 24.4}, {"w": "el", "s": 24.76, "e": 24.86}, {"w": "derecho", "s": 24.86, "e": 25.16}, {"w": "a", "s": 25.16, "e": 25.32}, {"w": "construir", "s": 25.32, "e": 25.8}, {"w": "y", "s": 25.8, "e": 26.12}, {"w": "el", "s": 26.12, "e": 26.22}, {"w": "derecho", "s": 26.22, "e": 26.6}, {"w": "a", "s": 26.6, "e": 26.78}, {"w": "la", "s": 26.78, "e": 26.82}, {"w": "privacidad.", "s": 26.82, "e": 27.42}]}, {"scene": "permiso", "text": "Lo que muchos no saben: construir requiere permiso municipal, y la obra debe respetar las normas de construcción.", "pause": 0.25, "start": 27.95, "end": 34.74, "words": [{"w": "Lo", "s": 27.95, "e": 28.13}, {"w": "que", "s": 28.13, "e": 28.25}, {"w": "muchos", "s": 28.25, "e": 28.49}, {"w": "no", "s": 28.49, "e": 28.85}, {"w": "saben,", "s": 28.85, "e": 29.23}, {"w": "construir", "s": 29.51, "e": 29.93}, {"w": "requiere", "s": 29.93, "e": 30.49}, {"w": "permiso", "s": 30.49, "e": 31.01}, {"w": "municipal", "s": 31.01, "e": 31.67}, {"w": "y", "s": 31.67, "e": 32.09}, {"w": "la", "s": 32.09, "e": 32.21}, {"w": "obra", "s": 32.21, "e": 32.39}, {"w": "debe", "s": 32.39, "e": 32.63}, {"w": "respetar", "s": 32.63, "e": 33.25}, {"w": "las", "s": 33.25, "e": 33.41}, {"w": "normas", "s": 33.41, "e": 33.81}, {"w": "de", "s": 33.81, "e": 33.87}, {"w": "construcción.", "s": 33.87, "e": 34.53}]}, {"scene": "vistas", "text": "Además, la ley establece reglas sobre ventanas y vistas hacia el terreno vecino, como distancias mínimas desde el lindero.", "pause": 0.35, "start": 34.99, "end": 42.17, "words": [{"w": "Además,", "s": 34.99, "e": 35.29}, {"w": "la", "s": 35.59, "e": 35.65}, {"w": "ley", "s": 35.65, "e": 35.87}, {"w": "establece", "s": 35.87, "e": 36.41}, {"w": "reglas", "s": 36.41, "e": 36.81}, {"w": "sobre", "s": 36.81, "e": 37.03}, {"w": "ventanas", "s": 37.03, "e": 37.53}, {"w": "y", "s": 37.53, "e": 37.71}, {"w": "vistas", "s": 37.71, "e": 38.15}, {"w": "hacia", "s": 38.15, "e": 38.53}, {"w": "el", "s": 38.53, "e": 38.69}, {"w": "terreno", "s": 38.69, "e": 39.07}, {"w": "vecino,", "s": 39.07, "e": 39.59}, {"w": "como", "s": 39.77, "e": 39.95}, {"w": "distancias", "s": 39.95, "e": 40.55}, {"w": "mínimas", "s": 40.55, "e": 41.17}, {"w": "desde", "s": 41.17, "e": 41.37}, {"w": "el", "s": 41.37, "e": 41.61}, {"w": "lindero.", "s": 41.61, "e": 42.03}]}, {"scene": "mito", "text": "Tapar la ventana a pedradas, o levantar un muro sin permiso para vengarse, solo agrava el conflicto.", "pause": 0.35, "start": 42.52, "end": 48.09, "words": [{"w": "Tapar", "s": 42.52, "e": 42.9}, {"w": "la", "s": 42.9, "e": 42.98}, {"w": "ventana", "s": 42.98, "e": 43.4}, {"w": "a", "s": 43.4, "e": 43.5}, {"w": "pedradas", "s": 43.5, "e": 43.96}, {"w": "o", "s": 43.96, "e": 44.36}, {"w": "levantar", "s": 44.36, "e": 44.86}, {"w": "un", "s": 44.86, "e": 44.96}, {"w": "muro", "s": 44.96, "e": 45.22}, {"w": "sin", "s": 45.22, "e": 45.38}, {"w": "permiso", "s": 45.38, "e": 45.88}, {"w": "para", "s": 45.88, "e": 46.08}, {"w": "vengarse", "s": 46.08, "e": 46.64}, {"w": "solo", "s": 46.64, "e": 47.02}, {"w": "agrava", "s": 47.02, "e": 47.44}, {"w": "el", "s": 47.44, "e": 47.52}, {"w": "conflicto.", "s": 47.52, "e": 48.06}]}, {"scene": "paso1", "text": "Lo recomendable: primero, conversar y buscar soluciones, como un vidrio opaco o una celosía.", "pause": 0.2, "start": 48.44, "end": 54.06, "words": [{"w": "Lo", "s": 48.44, "e": 48.6}, {"w": "recomendable,", "s": 48.6, "e": 49.28}, {"w": "primero", "s": 49.58, "e": 49.92}, {"w": "conversar", "s": 49.92, "e": 50.66}, {"w": "y", "s": 50.66, "e": 50.74}, {"w": "buscar", "s": 50.74, "e": 51.02}, {"w": "soluciones", "s": 51.02, "e": 51.78}, {"w": "como", "s": 51.78, "e": 52.06}, {"w": "un", "s": 52.06, "e": 52.2}, {"w": "vidrio", "s": 52.2, "e": 52.54}, {"w": "opaco", "s": 52.54, "e": 52.98}, {"w": "o", "s": 52.98, "e": 53.18}, {"w": "una", "s": 53.18, "e": 53.34}, {"w": "celosía.", "s": 53.34, "e": 53.88}]}, {"scene": "paso2", "text": "Segundo, consultar en la municipalidad si la obra tiene permiso.", "pause": 0.2, "start": 54.26, "end": 58.15, "words": [{"w": "Segundo,", "s": 54.26, "e": 54.78}, {"w": "consultar", "s": 54.92, "e": 55.52}, {"w": "en", "s": 55.52, "e": 55.6}, {"w": "la", "s": 55.6, "e": 55.68}, {"w": "municipalidad", "s": 55.68, "e": 56.46}, {"w": "si", "s"